// THE WILDERNESS FISHING SPOTS (13 October, moved east 15 October). Suggestion #10 asked for raw
// manta and sea turtle in the Wilderness by the dragons; until then both fish came from the Fishing
// Trawler and nowhere else - the skill guide said so out loud and the Fishing level-up messages at
// 79 and 81 told the player as much.
//
// WHERE (moved 15 October). Four spots down the west shore of the lake beside the EAST dragons:
// (3371,3685), (3367,3691), (3369,3697) and (3373,3700). The first home for them was the puddle in
// the middle of the west dragons - the only water within reach of that group, and about one tile of
// it. This is 165 tiles of real water with a shoreline to stand on, and the dragon group is twenty
// IN THE WATER, ON THE EDGE, which is what every other fishing spot in the game is: the spot npc
// stands on a water tile and the only walkable tile beside it is the bank. The lake was not blocked
// at all - 165 tiles of water you could stroll across - so this also flags it, the way the river at
// Lumbridge and the sea at Catherby are flagged. Check any cache spot and you will find the same
// shape: f1 under the npc, one neighbour without it.
//
// WILDERNESS 21 TO 23, from (z - 3520) / 8 + 1: 21 at the southern spot, 23 at the two northern
// ones. Deep enough to be a real decision and shallow enough to walk out of, which is the point:
// this is a sidegrade to the Trawler, not a replacement. See
// skill_fishing/scripts/fishing_spots/wildyfish.rs2 for the rest of that argument.
//
// FOUR SPOTS, NOT ONE, because one spot is a queue. They sit five or six tiles apart along the
// shore, so a taken one is a few steps from a free one.
//
// STILL STATIC: moverestrict=nomove and wanderrange=0, as every other spot in this build. A fishing
// spot that drifts is a fishing spot nobody can click twice; spread along a shoreline is what makes
// this read as a shoal, and it costs the player nothing.

[wildyfish]
name=Fishing spot
desc=I can see something big swimming in the water.
model1=compofishspot_8
vislevel=hide
readyanim=fishingspot_ready
walkanim=fishingspot_walk
minimap=no
op3=Harpoon
op5=hidden
wanderrange=0
moverestrict=nomove
category=wildyfish
